What this means for the port: dwc3 is being told about power events it does not
expect (irq_stat=3C1000) while the link reports state 0x0005, and it re-arms and
is told again. Nothing in the storm is an application's doing, and no app change
affects it. The port comes back by re-probing the charger IC that reports those
events - see the MUIC section of KLIPPER_ANDROID.md for the sequence, which only
works with the printer already attached.
